docs/dev/TASKS.md:172:T-006 `fde1537b5c4ba1bcef4f538dfb47276d564e4aaa` was published/read back exactly and issue #7 closed/completed before this task. T-007 uniquely maps to #8 in milestone #2. Added explicit eleven-file standard-library source builder at `tools/package_source.py`, extraction checker at `tools/check_distribution.py`, independent distribution integration checks, narrow tool-cache ignore and real distribution instructions/navigation. Existing ignore rules and coordinator resources remain intact. The ZIP has `textstats-source/` root and exactly five package modules, README, public API guide, two disclosure/usage notices and builder/checker. Credentials/caches/tests/development/coordinator/workflow material is excluded. Required missing/symlink source files fail, rather than silently producing an incomplete allowlist.
