docs/dev/TASKS.md:184:`python tools/check_tests.py` passed 23 unit and 18 integration tests on Python 3.12.14 without skips/warnings; `python tools/check_distribution.py` verified isolated extracted import and 36 actual module processes. Current source review found no remaining milestone blocker, docs/examples retain applicable executed evidence and TODO is None. T-005–T-007 commits were separately published/read back and issues #6–#8 closed before this review. T-008 uniquely maps to issue #9/milestone #2. Report, scoped repair/tests/docs, evidence, initial task checkbox and eligible milestone parent status close together; publish/read back before review issue closure and milestone #2 validation/closure. Phase review remains unchecked until that hosted gate succeeds.
docs/dev/TASKS.md:186:## T-009 completion evidence
docs/dev/TASKS.md:188:After T-008 `7b9f570aa4452d2ca9d6105479640528cb113f0e` was published/read back, issue #9 closed/completed and native milestone #2 closed/read back with all four associated issues closed, both delivery milestone gates were satisfied. Performed a separate coherent cross-milestone implementation code review and all Phase 1 exits, recorded in [phase report](reports/phases/1/PHASE-REPORT.md). M1.2-001 remains resolved and TODO is None; no additional production repair was required. T-009 uniquely maps to issue #10, milestone #3.
docs/dev/TASKS.md:190:Fresh product runner passed 23 unit and 18 integration tests on Python 3.12.14, no skips/warnings. Fresh extraction checker verified exact isolated import and 36 real module cases. Every current README/public-guide runnable fence, including separate extracted example, passed; documented discovery counts are nonzero, outputs are exact and user-guide links resolve. Complete branch-scope inspection retains coordinator resources/pinned package/publisher fixture unchanged. Bounded T-001–T-008 actual parent-diff audit confirms per-task result/evidence/initial checkbox composition and leading single owning IDs. T-009 report/evidence/initial task checkbox and eligible phase/review-milestone parent status close together, followed by verified publication and hosted issue/review-milestone closure. Then integrate the complete phase via explicit two-parent merge, verify merged state and publish/read back main; integration evidence belongs in that actual merge summary. Stop before Phase 2; all T-010–T-017 remain unchecked/unprojected. Broader runtime/platform matrix and release remain outside scope.
